      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "> The avatar preview should not be loaded (it failed security checks, and might not be one you own)\n\nFull blocking is not quite enabled on PC as of yet, when it is enabled the avatar preview will no longer load. The new functionality in the beta isn't behind the same gating.\n\n> You should not be able to change into the avatar\n\nThat is indeed a bug (or well two), if an avatar has failed for now the avatar details page should not be visitable and second that change avatar button should be disabled.",
