      "statusChangeNewStatus": "complete",
      "value": "A fix disabling various methods of switching to an avatar that has failed checks in UI has gotten out with the 2023.4.2 release. _This is not comprehensive for all methods of switching to an avatar_ but fulfils the main goals.\n\nExpect improvement on how it's disabled and messaging in future. Alongside this very soon without client change you will notice avatars that have failed checks will not load on PC (it's already the case on android)",
